          "end": 628.66,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " chances.",
          "start": 628.66,
          "end": 629.08,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "You either pull your own weight or you're jettisoned like so much luggage or baggage.",
