        },
        {
          "word": " limits.",
          "start": 656.5,
          "end": 657.35,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We can give people multiple chances, but at some point,",
      "start": 657.9,
      "end": 661.42,
      "speaker": "Catherine",
