          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " next",
          "start": 944.16,
          "end": 944.4,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " week.",
          "start": 944.4,
          "end": 944.7,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But God gives us what we need, in what form we need, when we need it,",
