          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[62:8]  Say, \"The death that you flee from will inevitably catch up with you. Then you will be turned over to the Knower of all secrets and declarations. He will inform you of everything you did.\"",
      "start": 1050.52,
      "end": 1059.7,
      "speaker": "Catherine",
