          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And simply say, I saw that and wait.",
      "start": 1101.04,
      "end": 1105.46,
      "speaker": "Catherine",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " And",
          "start": 1101.04,
