          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " death?",
          "start": 1362.78,
          "end": 1363.08,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And like Catherine said, we don't long for death because we know that the longer",
