        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[63:3]  They have believed, then disbelieved. Consequently, their hearts were sealed and consequently, they cannot understand.",
      "start": 3401.22,
      "end": 3407.33,
      "speaker": "Catherine",
      "words": [
        {
