        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[63:4]  When you see them, you may be impressed by their appearance. And when they speak, you hear their voice. But they are like wooden logs. They think that every cry is intended against them. Beware of them. GOD curses them for they have deviated.",
      "start": 3407.6,
      "end": 3420.81,
      "speaker": "Catherine",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " [63:4]",
          "start": 3407.6,
          "end": 3407.98,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
