        },
        {
          "word": " we",
          "start": 3525.52,
          "end": 3525.7,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " hear",
          "start": 3525.84,
          "end": 3526.0,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " in",
          "start": 3526.0,
          "end": 3526.32,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " all",
          "start": 3526.34,
          "end": 3526.48,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        },
        {
          "word": " things.",
          "start": 3526.48,
          "end": 3526.58,
          "speaker": "Catherine"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The test is to figure out where it is and what it is. If you know what the truth is from the beginning, you can recognize the distortions.",
