    },
    {
      "text": "So, \"La Elaha Ella Allah\" goes without saying. Then, after that, all the commandments are very important,",
      "start": 4321.64,
      "end": 4330.22,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
