          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, take your pick. It's very expensive if you...",
      "start": 4360.84,
      "end": 4364.56,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
