          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But that, that also, I think it's important to say that God knows what's true and we have to do God all gifts,",
      "start": 4365.08,
      "end": 4370.72,
      "speaker": "A woman",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " But",
